==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Monster Extracts are sold by [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] during the night. They can also be acquired as a reward for rescuing [[Chabi]], who is searching for the Fang and Bone. Though Monster Extracts cannot be eaten directly, [[Meal]]s made in a [[Cooking Pot]] with Monster Extract will have their effects randomly increased or decreased.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They are also one of the ingredients that can be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make [[Purple Dye]].

