==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
[[Monster Extract]]s can be obtained by completing the [[Quest]]s "[[Fang for Your Buck]]", "[[A Rumor about Skull Lake]]", "[[Cold Desert Nights]]", and "[[Visiting a Special Shop]]", and can be used for [[Cooking]] [[Monster Cake]], [[Monster Curry]], and [[Monster Stew]]. They can also be commonly sold for three [[Rupee]]s and specifically to [[Bena the Merchant]] for seven.
{{Noncanon|End}}

